{"example_id": "family_care-unrelated-00281", "negative_labels": [0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0], "positive_labels": [0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0], "relation": "unrelated", "split": "val", "supervision_mask": [1.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0], "target_index": 0, "target_value": "family_care", "text": "周末想找个地方放松一下，最好人少安静，有轻音乐，能一个人坐着发呆喝杯咖啡看看书的那种小店，不要太吵就行。"}
